{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1bdd47d753efc17c1b398b6352dcd17f90eb374df9435d85467bdf82beee1812",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad0c6836055e4cd1eee00a24582964c9a2d206689addccfb6655acaaf5f5c590",
      "text": "甜甜的气味与努力与友情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1659fe408b29902069f8b82e8b25074eaf56919370699503e58e598161628e68",
      "text": "朱雀最近很在意玄武身上飘着的甜甜气味。\n但玄武却说自己毫无头绪。\n然而，实际上玄武为了朱雀的生日，\n正在暗中进行着某项准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ceaf16be64dd5c8574a36d1fd3f176bd7e0046d1ef7d0980f998dbc267f85525",
      "text": "那么……\n朱雀的庆生准备这样也算大致就绪了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87c28d941c27dc171ed73f33c5fb59ce4387e4a775535471d98d5269479ed9d2",
      "text": "多亏了英雄大哥，\n总算能做出令人满意的松饼了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:205d3396572f229f057ef58fc280b8b90590c30640c7c341aad3753225d61836",
      "text": "画龙点睛。\n接下来只要等朱雀过来，请他吃刚出炉的就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1387a094c1f43294d18a28ed24a43bacb1ce8fbc4a11aadf270ca1df0a5e4c39",
      "text": "也已经拜托番长把他叫过来了，\n朱雀差不多也快到事务所了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8fd6a2e56c8c3862e862f6b0e14f3c4a89105d55c01883ee5a31c67579ef291",
      "text": "……朱雀那家伙，\n到底会露出怎样的表情高兴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cf2e8350eb504ccf1757403a8b3b095d54d25054b32e6ad49638985ab5f93a9",
      "text": "为了今天，你居然一直在练习做松饼啊。\n很不容易吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2347974a9dc5add207f886c285d4b6724c9d8acdcff488f08a5f92cc053e102e",
      "text": "为了做出理想的松饼，我试了各种食谱。\n比如加豆腐什么的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21afa0c2ddfb881ca5d067a937e7cee922ae9c2f7ad3b951196abf89cd8c062d",
      "text": "豆腐！？加在松饼里吗？完全想象\n不出来啊，会是什么味道啊……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd65b93b57d664d0a327cf9dc112a9d0be1bbccd35aa84541f00ef2521485672",
      "text": "与其说是味道变了，不如说是面糊变得很松软。\n那种也相当不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c90f5e3f3a9f80fd22221e0384b12c0f4934561b850b3a58758af0f1f70a125",
      "text": "嘿，那可真是太燃了！虽然有嚼劲的和\n湿润绵密的我都喜欢，但松软的也想尝尝看啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7c13a3e9d6eb43063cc69e4e6d2a869b4b7ac3e204d1f633b2099b78f295f91",
      "text": "那下次我也给你做那种吧。\n你吃得那么香的样子，我也想再看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
